          "description": "Fluency Theater – Volume 1 turns reading practice into a playful performance! Early readers follow along with short, silly plays that focus on phonics skills like short vowels, blends, and digraphs. Kids practice expression, pacing, and fluency while laughing through fun scenes. Print the scripts to read along and watch confidence grow with every line. Perfect for Pre-K through 1st grade, this audio makes learning to read exciting, interactive, and screen-free!",
